{"seq":1,"slug":"marketing-principles","title":"大学工商管理 — 市场营销原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/marketing-principles","wordCount":2045,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学工商管理-市场营销原理\">大学工商管理 — 市场营销原理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>市场营销（Marketing）的本质是识别并满足人类和社会的需求，同时实现企业的盈利目标。菲利普·科特勒将其定义为&quot;创造、传播、传递客户价值，并管理客户关系以使组织和利益相关者受益的过程&quot;。营销不是简单的推销或广告，而是一个从市场洞察开始、贯穿价值创造和传递、最终实现顾客终身价值的系统化过程。</p>\n<p>全球营销支出占企业收入的比重平均为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%\\text{-}12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>，B2C 企业可高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%\\text{-}20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>。在数字化时代，营销的边界正在扩展——数据驱动的精准营销、社交媒体的口碑传播和人工智能辅助的个性化推荐正在重塑传统营销范式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"营销核心概念\">营销核心概念</h3><p><strong>需要、欲望与需求</strong>：需要（Need）是人的基本状态缺失感，如饥饿、安全、社交；欲望（Want）是需要在特定文化和个人经历下的具体表现形式——饥饿时，中国人想吃面条，美国人想吃汉堡；需求（Demand）是有购买力支撑的欲望。营销者不创造需要，但塑造欲望、刺激需求。</p>\n<p><strong>顾客价值与满意</strong>：顾客感知价值（Customer Perceived Value）是顾客对产品总收益与总成本之差的主观评估：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CPV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>总顾客收益</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>总顾客成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CPV} = \\text{总顾客收益} - \\text{总顾客成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CPV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总顾客收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总顾客成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>总收益包括产品价值、服务价值、人员价值和形象价值；总成本包括货币成本、时间成本、精力成本和心理成本。顾客选择 CPV 最高的方案。一杯星巴克咖啡售价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 元，超出便利店咖啡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，但消费者愿意支付溢价是因为他们感知到了品牌形象、空间体验和社交价值带来的额外收益。</p>\n<p><strong>顾客满意</strong>：满意度 = 感知效果 / 预期。感知 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 预期时产生满意甚至惊喜，感知 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 预期时产生不满。管理启示：企业不应过度承诺（拉高预期），而应适度承诺、超额交付。</p>\n<h3 id=\"市场营销环境分析\">市场营销环境分析</h3><p><strong>STP 战略</strong>（市场细分、目标市场选择、市场定位）是营销战略的核心框架：</p>\n<p><strong>市场细分</strong>（Segmentation）：将异质市场划分为若干同质子市场。常用细分变量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>细分维度</th>\n<th>变量示例</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地理细分</td>\n<td>国家、城市级别、气候</td>\n<td>区域化产品策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人口统计</td>\n<td>年龄、收入、教育、职业</td>\n<td>大众消费品定价分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心理细分</td>\n<td>生活方式、价值观、人格</td>\n<td>品牌形象塑造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为细分</td>\n<td>使用频率、品牌忠诚度、追求利益</td>\n<td>精准营销和会员体系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有效细分的标准（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个&quot;可&quot;）：可衡量、可进入、可盈利、可区分、可行动。</p>\n<p><strong>目标市场选择</strong>（Targeting）：评估各细分市场的吸引力（市场规模、增长率、竞争强度、与企业资源的匹配度），选择 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个或多个细分市场作为目标。策略选项从窄到宽：集中营销（单一细分）→ 差异化营销（多个细分，各有定制）→ 无差异营销（全市场统一策略）。</p>\n<p><strong>市场定位</strong>（Positioning）：在目标顾客心中建立区别于竞争者的独特位置。定位声明的经典格式：&quot;对于[目标顾客]，[品牌]是[品类]中的[差异化价值]，因为[支撑理由]。&quot;沃尔沃的定位：&quot;对于注重家庭安全的车主，沃尔沃是最安全的汽车品牌，因为其在安全技术上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 年持续创新。&quot;</p>\n<h3 id=\"营销组合-4p\">营销组合（4P）</h3><p><strong>产品策略</strong>（Product）：产品的三层次模型——核心产品（顾客真正购买的利益）、实体产品（品质、特色、设计、品牌、包装）和附加产品（安装、售后、保修、配送）。产品生命周期（PLC）分为导入期、成长期、成熟期和衰退期，各阶段的营销策略差异显著：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导入期：高投入建立知名度，选择性分销，利润为负</li>\n<li>成长期：差异化竞争加剧，扩大分销，利润快速上升</li>\n<li>成熟期：竞争最激烈，利润开始下降，通过产品改进和市场开发延长生命周期</li>\n<li>衰退期：收割（缩减投入获取剩余利润）或退出</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>定价策略</strong>（Price）：定价方法包括成本导向（成本加成法，加成率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%\\text{-}50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 不等）、竞争导向（参照竞品定价）和价值导向（基于顾客感知价值定价）。心理定价策略如尾数定价（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>199</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥199</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">199</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>）利用了左位数效应——消费者对价格第一位数字的敏感度远高于后续数字。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道策略</strong>（Place）：分销渠道层级从零级（厂家直销）到多级（厂家 → 代理商 → 批发商 → 零售商）。渠道选择的关键决策：密集分销（尽可能多的终端，如饮料）、选择性分销（有限的授权经销商，如家电）和独家分销（区域内仅一家经销商，如奢侈品）。</p>\n<p><strong>促销策略</strong>（Promotion）：整合营销传播（IMC）将广告、销售促进、公共关系、人员推销和直接营销统一在一致的品牌信息下。AIDA 模型描述了传播效果的层次：引起注意（Attention）→ 产生兴趣（Interest）→ 激发欲望（Desire）→ 促成行动（Action）。数字时代，AIDA 被扩展为 AISAS（增加搜索 Search 和分享 Share），反映了消费者主动信息搜索和社交分享的行为变化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"营销新趋势\">营销新趋势</h3><p><strong>关系营销与顾客终身价值</strong>：获取新客户的成本是留住老客户的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。顾客终身价值（CLV）的简化计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CLV</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLV} = \\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\frac{M_t \\times R_t}{(1+d)^t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年的边际利润，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年的留存率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为折现率。一个年消费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span> 元、留存率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>、边际利润率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 的客户，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 年 CLV 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>7200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥7200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7200</span></span></span></span></span>（折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>）。CLV 思维推动企业从&quot;交易导向&quot;转向&quot;关系导向&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>数字营销</strong>：搜索引擎营销（SEM/SEO）、社交媒体营销、内容营销和营销自动化正在成为主流。核心指标体系包括：CAC（客户获取成本）、LTV/CAC 比率（健康值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>）、转化率漏斗、ROAS（广告支出回报率）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选择一个你日常消费的品牌（如喜茶、优衣库或小米），用 STP 框架分析其市场细分、目标市场选择和市场定位策略。</li>\n<li>为什么奢侈品品牌（如爱马仕、LV）几乎从不打折促销？从顾客感知价值和品牌定位的角度分析。</li>\n<li>分析拼多多的定价策略和渠道策略如何与其目标市场定位（下沉市场）一致。</li>\n<li>计算一家订阅制 SaaS 企业的顾客终身价值：月订阅费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\¥</mtext></mstyle><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\¥200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">¥</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>，月留存率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>，边际利润率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>，折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>/年。CLV 是多少？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>阅读科特勒《营销管理》的&quot;营销近视症&quot;经典论述</li>\n<li>了解<strong>增长黑客</strong>（Growth Hacking）方法论在互联网创业公司中的应用</li>\n<li>研究<strong>行为经济学</strong>如何影响营销策略——锚定效应、框架效应和损失厌恶的营销应用</li>\n<li>探索<strong>营销伦理</strong>议题：数据隐私、算法推荐的信息茧房和暗示操纵</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>市场营销原理构建了从顾客洞察到价值传递的完整方法论。STP 战略帮助企业找准目标市场和差异化定位，4P 营销组合提供了产品、价格、渠道和促销的系统化决策框架，CLV 思维将营销视角从短期交易拉长到长期关系。在数据和技术驱动的新时代，营销的基本原理并未过时——变化的是工具和渠道，不变的是对顾客需求的深刻理解和价值创造的核心逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学工商管理 — 市场营销原理","id":"大学工商管理-市场营销原理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"营销核心概念","id":"营销核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"市场营销环境分析","id":"市场营销环境分析"},{"level":3,"text":"营销组合（4P）","id":"营销组合-4p"},{"level":3,"text":"营销新趋势","id":"营销新趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学工商管理 — 战略管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/business-administration/management-principles/strategic-management"},"next":{"title":"大学工商管理 — 消费者行为","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/business-administration/marketing/consumer-behavior"}}